# Summon Warhorse for Alliance Paladins: The Tome of Nobility.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (Mount: the spell
# is still a Forever mount; ItemSparse); quests.json and npcs.json for the
# chain.
# Forever's Forsaken Paladins have their own warhorse quest (A Trusty Steed, in
# the beta client); its giver and steps are not
# published or in our data yet, so this guide covers Humans and Dwarves only.

step The Tome of Nobility (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 40 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light. Take the tram from Ironforge to Stormwind.
  level 40
  accept 4486

step Summon Warhorse
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Duthorian Rall stands in the Cathedral of Light. Turning in the Tome of Nobility teaches Summon Warhorse; Paladins do not buy a mount.
  level 40
  accept 1661 only Human
  turnin 1661 only Human
  turnin 4486 only Dwarf
  learn 13819 "Summon Warhorse"
